# @hub-lanes

# ── PROGRESS PUSH (K2, outside dead-man) ────────────────────────────────────
# bin/progress-push.sh — per-project progress stamps, spend, pending work and
# each detector's last run, plus the thresholds from this lane's settings rows,
# to the watchdog worker. The worker judges them on its own */5 cron and pages
# Telegram directly (docs/OUTSIDE-DEADMAN.md). Behind the hub lease like every
# hub lane: if the lease (or cron) stops this, the push goes stale and the
# watchdog pages for exactly that.
# Kill: bin/harness-ctl.sh off progress-push.
*/10 * * * * /root/harness/bin/hub-lease.sh check && /root/harness/bin/progress-push.sh >/dev/null 2>&1
